pResponse` before runtime peer computation\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 7 out of 7 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| hscontrol/state/state.go | Sets `OriginNode` on the change returned by `SetNodeTags` to enable self-update propagation |\r\n| hscontrol/types/change/change.go | Preserves `OriginNode` and `TargetNode` fields during merge operations |\r\n| hscontrol/mapper/batcher.go | Adds early self-update check before runtime peer computation path |\r\n| hscontrol/types/change/change_test.go | Adds unit tests for `OriginNode` and `TargetNode` preservation in merge |\r\n| integration/tags_test.go | Adds comprehensive reproduction test and updates 8 existing tests to verify node self view |\r\n| .github/workflows/test-integration.yaml | Adds new test to CI workflow |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/juanfont/headscale/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2996#pullrequestreview-3669689249","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2996","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2996#pullrequestreview-3669689249"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2996"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-16T09:13:10Z","commit_id":"6c852a6e83894858dd69c8760801f6427f7a3f8e"},{"id":3670329683,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz887axMlT","user":{"login":"kr